/-! # Native Weil localizing hulls and ordinary Brown adjoints

Source: blueprint `cor-coef-verdier-weil-equivariance.proof.md`, final exceptional-adjunction
sentence, and `sk-prop-int-brown-construction.proof.md`, open/proper bullets and final paragraph.
The native specialization is the DAG's ordinary-derived cyclic-resolution and solution-set
